repository-code: "https://github.com/galixiaomaohan/scope-code-data"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary code and raw data for "SCOPE: Certified Theorem Proving
  with a Language Model as the Policy Planner" (arXiv:2610.08319):
  the experiment pipeline (gen33-44), the frozen Lean judging module,
  the raw experiment outputs behind every reading in the paper, and the
  complete generation chain of the data figures.
